<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>

<!--
	Choices that follow the model while they are displayed.
	
	The left pane lists the appointment categories with commands to create and delete one. The right
	pane offers a category in two ways: a <value-input> of the category type without an options
	expression, and the form field of the reference Appointment#category. A category created or
	deleted on the left is offered respectively no longer offered by both at once, without a new
	login - also while the form is being edited.
-->
<view>
	<channels>
		<channel name="model"/>
		<channel name="category"/>
		<channel name="chosenCategory"/>
		<channel name="appointment"/>
	</channels>
	<split-panel
		orientation="horizontal"
		resizable="true"
	>
		<panes>
			<pane
				size="40"
				unit="%"
			>
				<panel>
					<title>
						<en>Categories</en>
						<de>Kategorien</de>
					</title>
					<commands>
						<generic-command
							image="css:bi bi-plus-lg"
							placement="TOOLBAR"
						>
							<label>
								<en>New category</en>
								<de>Neue Kategorie</de>
							</label>
							<create-transient type="demo.calendar:AppointmentCategory">
								<with-result>
									<open-dialog
										bind-input-to="model"
										dialog-view="demo/create-appointment-category.view.xml"
									>
										<bind
											channel="selection"
											to="category"
										/>
									</open-dialog>
								</with-result>
							</create-transient>
						</generic-command>
						<generic-command
							image="css:bi bi-trash"
							inputs="category"
							placement="TOOLBAR"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Delete</en>
								<de>Löschen</de>
							</label>
							<executability>
								<null-input-disabled/>
							</executability>
							<delete-object/>
							<write-channel name="category"
								clear="true"
							/>
						</generic-command>
					</commands>
					<table
						observed-types="demo.calendar:AppointmentCategory"
						selection="category"
						types="demo.calendar:AppointmentCategory"
					>
						<columns>
							<column
								attribute="name"
								sort="ASC"
							/>
							<column attribute="color"/>
						</columns>
						<rows>all(`demo.calendar:AppointmentCategory`)</rows>
					</table>
				</panel>
			</pane>
			<pane
				size="60"
				unit="%"
			>
				<stack
					direction="column"
					gap="default"
				>
					<panel with-inset="true">
						<title>
							<en>Choose a category</en>
							<de>Kategorie auswählen</de>
						</title>
						<text>
							<label>
								<en>Create a category on the left with "New category", then open the selection below: the new category is there right away, without logging in again. Delete it on the left and it is gone from the selection just as quickly.</en>
								<de>Legen Sie links mit „Neue Kategorie“ eine Kategorie an und öffnen Sie dann die Auswahl unten: Die neue Kategorie steht sofort zur Auswahl, ohne neue Anmeldung. Löschen Sie sie links wieder, ist sie ebenso schnell aus der Auswahl verschwunden.</de>
							</label>
						</text>
						<fields max-columns="1">
							<value-input
								type="demo.calendar:AppointmentCategory"
								value="chosenCategory"
							>
								<label>
									<en>Category</en>
									<de>Kategorie</de>
								</label>
							</value-input>
						</fields>
					</panel>
					<panel with-inset="true">
						<title>
							<en>Edit an appointment</en>
							<de>Termin bearbeiten</de>
						</title>
						<text>
							<label>
								<en>Choose an appointment and click "Edit". While the form is open, create a category on the left: you can pick it in the appointment's "Category" field right away, without closing and reopening the form. (If there is no appointment yet, create one in the calendar demo.)</en>
								<de>Wählen Sie einen Termin und klicken Sie auf „Bearbeiten“. Legen Sie dann, während das Formular offen ist, links eine Kategorie an: Sie können sie sofort im Feld „Kategorie“ des Termins auswählen, ohne das Formular zu schließen und neu zu öffnen. (Gibt es noch keinen Termin, legen Sie einen in der Kalender-Demo an.)</de>
							</label>
						</text>
						<fields max-columns="1">
							<value-input
								type="demo.calendar:Appointment"
								value="appointment"
							>
								<label>
									<en>Appointment</en>
									<de>Termin</de>
								</label>
							</value-input>
						</fields>
						<form
							input="appointment"
							max-columns="1"
						>
							<field attribute="name"/>
							<field attribute="category"/>
						</form>
					</panel>
				</stack>
			</pane>
		</panes>
	</split-panel>
</view>